{"chapter-slug":"rw7-48 K","paragraph":421,"wording":"[Thug]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The [Thief] nodded. Wilovan adjusted his jacket. Neither one said it. Of course, it was just an observation. Of course they weren’t being paid to investigate. But they were [Thief] and [Thug].","id":"2e3de949-51c6-5c09-a123-6b6e990ad05f"}
